@startuml
title APT-SD-D01 Assisted Payment Terminal Logical Architecture
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Assisted Payment Terminal\n<<channel / terminal workflow surface>>" as APT
component "Cashier-Assisted Terminal mode\nnormal staffed mode" as CAT
component "Continuity Terminal mode\nrestricted, disabled by default" as CT
component "Central PMS\n<<payment finality + ExitAuthorization authority>>" as Central
component "Central PMS / Discount workflow\n<<discount policy authority>>" as Discount
component "Payment Orchestrator\nprovider outcome reporting" as Pay
component "Payment Provider\nexternal rail" as Provider
component "Resolved Site POS Server\n<<Sales Invoice authority>>" as POS
component "Vendor PMS Connector\nintegration boundary" as Connector
component "Vendor PMS / HCP\nnormal session + tariff authority" as Vendor
component "Operator Console\n<<non-payment governance>>" as OC
component "Management Dashboard\n<<visibility only>>" as Dash
component "Audit / Event / Reconciliation" as Audit
component "Gate / Exit\nconsumes Central PMS authorization" as Gate

APT --> CAT
APT --> CT
APT --> Central : lookup / capture / payment initiation / status display
Central --> Discount : statutory validation workflow
Central --> Pay : payment workflow
Pay --> Provider : provider-controlled interaction
Central --> POS : fiscal issuance request
Central --> Connector : vendor lookup / fee / projection context
Connector --> Vendor : vendor interaction
APT --> OC : supervisor / exception handoff
APT --> Audit : terminal activity context
Central --> Gate : ExitAuthorization when eligible
Central --> Dash : status and visibility facts

note bottom
APT captures and displays workflow state only.
Projection is operational visibility and controlled degraded support only.
end note
@enduml
